WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.834
After more than

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.368
a year of

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.069
waging war in Ukraine,

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.838
Russians are now experiencing

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.973
some of the violence on their own soil

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.141
in Belgorod,

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:09.609
just across the border from Ukraine.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.410
The region's governor

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.845
says at least four people

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:12.445
were injured

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:12.846
after what

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:15.148
they're describing as a massive strike.

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:16.182
That follows

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:16.683
a possible

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:17.217
drone attack

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:19.386
overnight on a Russian oil refinery

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:20.520
See the pictures there.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.155
Local officials say a fire

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.289
put out quickly

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:24.924
and there were no casualties.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.192
Still, the scope of these attacks,

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.794
the frequency drawing attention.

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.462
CNN's Fred Pleitgen, he's in Kiev.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.263
And, Fred,

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:31.931
we've seen a series of these attacks

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.033
on both Russian

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.200
held territory in Ukraine,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.502
but also crucially,

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:37.537
the territory of Russia.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.039
What are Ukrainian officials

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.307
saying about this or are they keeping

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.375
deliberately coy

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.846
Well, first, I would say

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:47.447
they're absolutely

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.581
keeping deliberately coy,

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.283
but they certainly are making suggestions

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.151
that possibly

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.485
they might have a certain role

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.053
in all of this.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:53.987
It was quite interesting

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:54.754
earlier today, Jim,

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.823
that adviser to Ukraine's presidency,

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:57.690
he came out

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.159
and he said, look, we're not going to say

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:00.193
that we're behind all this.

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:00.660
However,

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.661
one of the things that he did

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:02.595
say is that

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:04.664
attacks like these are going to increase,

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.366
that the war is increasingly

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.867
going to come to Russians

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.435
and are going to come

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.103
especially to those border areas.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:10.670
In Russia,

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:11.304
you had, of course,

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.739
that drone attack in Moscow,

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.140
which the Ukrainians have said

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.476
that they had no direct involvement in.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.244
Obviously, that a statement in itself.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.046
But if we look at that Belgorod region,

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:21.181
the one that you were talking about,

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.148
I think that's something

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.117
that is really key when we look at that,

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.418
because from there, we've been hearing

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.187
about cross-border attacks really

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.521
for the past couple of weeks.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:29.355
Last week

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.757
you had that raid by those

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.093
anti-Putin, Russian fighters

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:34.294
that went across the border

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.428
there in Belgorod.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.497
Today, you have that shelling

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.264
which the governor

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:38.665
there said

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:39.999
he's extremely concerned about.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.101
And I was looking at the area

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:41.668
where that is.

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:42.902
It's in a village called Shabak.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.671
You know, which is right by the border.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:45.872
It's a small little village,

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.707
but it is also very close

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.309
to the actual town of Belgorod,

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:49.809
which, of course,

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:52.579
we know Jim is a major logistic hubs

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.279
not just

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.881
for the Russian military in itself,

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:57.450
but also for their invasion of Ukraine.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.151
So certainly

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.220
this is having an unnerving effect

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.020
on the Russians,

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.255
on the Russian military,

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:02.956
and very much

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:03.323
also on

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.924
the people who live down there, Jim.

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:05.525
Listen, I remember

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:06.693
you standing on that border

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:07.727
not far from Belgorod

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:09.796
at the very first stages of this war,

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.898
watching those Russian tanks roll in.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:13.900
Fred, partaken in the capital, Kiev.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:14.767
Thanks so much.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.302
The key is getting a break.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:16.903
After days

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:18.872
of incessant Russian strikes over,

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:20.940
we are seeing an uptick in action

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:21.975
across the border.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:23.643
Five people were wounded in attacks

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.345
in Russia's Belgorod region,

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:27.547
something the Kremlin calls alarming.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.717
And they may not be let up any time soon.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.951
A group of dissident

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:32.919
Russian fighters

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:34.454
who claimed last week's incursion

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.856
inside Belgorod is now recruiting

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:38.224
drone pilots.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.260
This comes a day after a drone attack

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.127
on Moscow.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:41.895
Russia's foreign

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:44.030
ministry blames Ukraine

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.665
and is vowing to retaliate.

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.600
CNN has our report.

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.174
Same war, different capital,

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:57.076
Moscow hit by a squadron of eight drones,

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.912
just enough to say

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:00.180
there was a deafening bang,

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.614
as if a huge bolt of lightning

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:03.883
had struck. Somewhere near

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:05.251
the attack was immediately

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.586
blamed on Ukraine,

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:07.954
which reels daily

00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:10.123
from Russian air assaults,

00:03:10.123 --> 00:03:12.158
neutral escapism.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:12.759
This morning,

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:13.726
the Kiev regime

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:14.327
carried out

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.563
a terrorist attack on the Moscow region

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:17.997
and I will stress

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:20.099
aimed at civilian targets.

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:20.833
In total,

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.902
eight airplane type drones were used.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:25.471
All of them were brought down.

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:26.372
I won't kill you.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.141
Kiev was coy about its role

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:30.543
in this drastic escalation.

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:32.178
Of course, we enjoy watching

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:33.947
and predicting an increase in attacks.

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:35.615
But of course, we have nothing to do

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:36.950
directly with it.

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:37.717
What is growing in

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.252
Russia is the karmic payment

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:39.619
that Russia

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.387
will gradually pay more highly

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.556
for everything it does in Ukraine.

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:44.924
And at the capital,

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:45.992
Ukraine's threatening

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:48.294
and offensive to drive Russian troops out

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:49.662
Part of its tactics

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:50.930
have been increased efforts

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.166
to destabilize Moscow's forces.

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.136
A cross-border raid by anti-Putin,

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.738
Russian dissidents

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:01.040
was backed by Ukraine last week.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.442
Frequent attacks on Russian

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:04.043
occupied logistic hubs

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:06.312
like Mariupol and Birdy UNSC.

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:08.715
And now there's a mysterious drone attack

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:10.316
that Russia has blamed on

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:12.318
Ukraine is to get them as quickly

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:13.052
as we can.

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:14.187
Though I'm more worried

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:15.054
not by this,

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:15.822
but by efforts

00:04:15.822 --> 00:04:17.490
to provoke a Russian response

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.292
that appears to be the aim.

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:21.461
They are provoking us to do the same.

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:24.464
But this is the first drone attack

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:27.300
by anyone on Moscow outside the Kremlin.

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:31.504
Here.

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:33.906
Kiev attacked for the 17th time

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:35.775
this month, Friday.

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:37.243
But Putin's generals

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:38.745
now know that they face attacks

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:42.048
on Ukraine's front lines and at home.

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:44.617
Sam Kiley, CNN, Eastern Ukraine.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:48.388
Well, CNN

00:04:48.388 --> 00:04:51.090
Sam Kiley is with us right now.

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:52.392
We've heard the messaging

00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:53.493
coming through from Russia

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:54.961
saying they're ready to retaliate.

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:56.596
Ukraine says they're not to blame

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:59.232
for what we've seen in Belgorod.

00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:01.200
And Kiev is quiet,

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.303
which I think is very telling.

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:05.071
The big concern here is that

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:07.440
the war could be moving to Russia.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.375
What are you hearing, Sam?

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:14.047
Well, I'm not sure it's a concern at all.

00:05:14.047 --> 00:05:15.181
Lenny, if you're Ukrainian,

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:16.983
you'll be absolutely delighted

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.451
by that development.

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:21.254
And there is indeed widespread

00:05:22.121 --> 00:05:24.457
irony and delight over the fact that

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:26.259
now the Ukrainians

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:27.760
are beginning to show the Russians

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.163
what being at war really feels like.

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:31.964
Now, the downside of that,

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:34.701
obviously, is that inevitably

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:38.171
the number of people being injured

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:40.740
and killed are civilians.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:43.076
But the Ukrainians do appear to be trying

00:05:43.076 --> 00:05:43.443
at least

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:45.178
to focus their attentions

00:05:45.178 --> 00:05:45.978
on strategic

00:05:45.978 --> 00:05:47.747
targets like the

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:50.016
oil refinery down in Krasnodar orbit.

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:51.351
Local authorities

00:05:51.351 --> 00:05:52.418
much further north,

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:53.820
just on the northern border

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.955
between Ukraine and Russia

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:57.590
in the Belgorod region.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:58.057
I've said that

00:05:58.057 --> 00:05:59.025
six people there

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:00.259
and all of them civilians

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:00.960
have been injured,

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.062
that children are having to be evacuated

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:04.764
from alongside

00:06:04.764 --> 00:06:07.266
other civilians from border villages

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:08.568
as what is now becoming

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:10.770
almost routine cross-border shelling

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:11.904
by Ukraine

00:06:11.904 --> 00:06:12.939
into Russia

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:15.308
the other way round had become

00:06:15.942 --> 00:06:17.610
dangerously routine

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.978
throughout this war

00:06:18.978 --> 00:06:20.713
on an almost daily basis.

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:21.748
Northern villages

00:06:21.748 --> 00:06:23.182
are getting shelled by Russia.

00:06:23.182 --> 00:06:26.452
So we're seeing this as part of a

00:06:26.486 --> 00:06:28.688
I think, the early stages or perhaps

00:06:28.688 --> 00:06:30.423
even the main focus

00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:32.759
of Ukraine's counter offensive

00:06:32.759 --> 00:06:34.427
adviser to President Zelensky

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:36.028
has said on national TV

00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:36.662
that there's going to be

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:38.398
an exponential increase

00:06:38.398 --> 00:06:39.866
in these sorts of attacks.

00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:40.233
The problem

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:41.834
for the international community

00:06:41.834 --> 00:06:43.803
is that there are undertakings

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:44.470
from the Ukrainians

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:45.772
not to use the weapons

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:48.541
donated by foreign powers for attacks

00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:49.509
inside Russia.

00:06:49.509 --> 00:06:50.476
But James Cleverly,

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:51.344
the foreign secretary

00:06:51.344 --> 00:06:52.478
of the United Kingdom,

00:06:52.478 --> 00:06:53.679
given a bit of top cover

00:06:53.679 --> 00:06:54.514
or even a green light

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:55.281
for the Ukrainians,

00:06:55.281 --> 00:06:56.449
saying that attacks

00:06:56.449 --> 00:06:58.050
against military infrastructure

00:06:58.050 --> 00:06:59.318
inside Russia

00:06:59.318 --> 00:07:00.353
was consistent

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:02.422
with Ukraine's right to self-defense

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:04.357
and were there for legitimate targets.

00:07:04.357 --> 00:07:06.058
And as a consequence of that,

00:07:06.058 --> 00:07:07.627
he's been added

00:07:07.627 --> 00:07:09.762
or the rather the Kremlin,

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.999
via Medvedev, the former

00:07:12.999 --> 00:07:14.133
president and prime minister,

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:15.968
now deputy head of the

00:07:15.968 --> 00:07:16.769
National Security

00:07:16.769 --> 00:07:19.105
Council in Russia, has tweeted out,

00:07:19.338 --> 00:07:20.473
saying that members

00:07:20.473 --> 00:07:21.240
of the British government

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.608
now considered legitimate

00:07:22.608 --> 00:07:24.710
military targets by Russia.

00:07:24.744 --> 00:07:25.878
That is part of the sort

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:27.580
of public relations tit for tat.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.282
But the significance really is

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:31.350
that James Cleverly has come out and said

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:33.319
that as far as the United Kingdom

00:07:33.319 --> 00:07:34.320
is concerned,

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.422
within certain parameters, they're fine

00:07:36.422 --> 00:07:38.624
with the idea that Russia gets attacked

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.026
by Ukraine and any

00:07:44.063 --> 00:07:44.430
kind.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.131
Thank you so much.

